  - file: Map_of_Assyria_Paris_Peace_Conference_1919.jpg
    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Map_of_Assyria_Paris_Peace_Conference_1919.jpg/500px-Map_of_Assyria_Paris_Peace_Conference_1919.jpg
